<title>USA: Recoton to acquire Tambalan Ltd.</title>
<headline>Recoton to acquire Tambalan Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE MARY, Fla. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recoton Corp said Thursday it signed a nonbinding letter of intent for the acquisition of Tambalan Ltd, a marketer of consumer electronic accessory products under the Ross Consumer Products brand name.</p>
<p>Tambalan is located in Farnworth-Bolton, England and has an operation in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to close in February 1997 subject to several conditions, Recoton said.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed and the company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
